{"3397720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Alchemist: Journey of the Soul Prologue", "steam_appid": 3397720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">(This is a single player prologue game for <strong><i>Alchemist: Journey of the Soul</i></strong>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397720/extras/538a37c4bbeaca455ab4b15bf71fadae.avif?t=1763472049\" width=600 height=119 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A voice calls to you—a familiar presence, <i>the Alchemist</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">He speaks of a place that calls to him, an ancient monastery at the mountain’s peak, where your true purpose will unfold. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397720/extras/444d4c29b8284d55011d16a1f1c1f367.poster.avif?t=1763472049\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397720/extras/444d4c29b8284d55011d16a1f1c1f367.webm?t=1763472049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore the monastery, solve puzzles and brew powerful potions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397720/extras/6840bba7f85ffe45f9ff245f0152659a.poster.avif?t=1763472049\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397720/extras/6840bba7f85ffe45f9ff245f0152659a.webm?t=1763472049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">With each new potion a new ability is unlocked. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397720/extras/96a4340c486db2025818dd20600c3b46.poster.avif?t=1763472049\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397720/extras/96a4340c486db2025818dd20600c3b46.webm?t=1763472049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You’ll need to observe closely and think carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397720/extras/cd24d06a8dfeaba6c75970d329bddeea.poster.avif?t=1763472049\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397720/extras/cd24d06a8dfeaba6c75970d329bddeea.webm?t=1763472049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Α portal opens. A door beyond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">And your journey is only just beginning...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>WISHLIST NOW</i></strong> and follow the journey to its end!</h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">(This is a single player prologue game for <strong><i>Alchemist: Journey of the Soul</i></strong>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397720/extras/538a37c4bbeaca455ab4b15bf71fadae.avif?t=1763472049\" width=600 height=119 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A voice calls to you—a familiar presence, <i>the Alchemist</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">He speaks of a place that calls to him, an ancient monastery at the mountain’s peak, where your true purpose will unfold. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397720/extras/444d4c29b8284d55011d16a1f1c1f367.poster.avif?t=1763472049\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397720/extras/444d4c29b8284d55011d16a1f1c1f367.webm?t=1763472049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore the monastery, solve puzzles and brew powerful potions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397720/extras/6840bba7f85ffe45f9ff245f0152659a.poster.avif?t=1763472049\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steams